  "description": {
   "en": "\"Late at night, alone on my bed, your voice was the only thing that saved me. I want to talk to you again. There's something I want to say.\"\n\nWithout knowing her real name or face, Yamabuki Arisu, a second-year high school student, was looking for a girl named \"Apollo'' who was a livestreamer. However, one day, Arisu gets a clue about Apollo from the broadcast club of the high school where she is going. There were 4 beautiful girls who dreamed of \"getting a job related to voice\"!! Who is Apollo? What will happen to the dreams of the four people?"
  },
